          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Precor builds for facilities, and Peloton has owned it since 2021. For a household that
            makes <strong class="text-white">the used gym-refit market the route</strong> — machines
            released on capital cycles rather than because they are worn out, at a small fraction of
            commercial pricing.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Confirm the electrical supply and the delivery route before you agree a price; those two
            checks are where this purchase actually goes wrong. Then
            <a href="/treadmill-repair/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">find a commercial technician</a>
            early, and you have bought one treadmill instead of three.
          </p>
